| M1 — DDQN, 60 min, reward base | 4,58 | 4,72 | 4,55 | 4,50 | **4,59** | 12.792 | 2,99 | 4,93 |
| M2 — Q1 míope, 60 min, reward progressivo | 4,72 | 4,56 | 4,54 | 4,54 | **4,59** | 12.671 | 2,98 | 4,93 |
